      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Anima Komikku · SnapRef\n\nOne Anima prompt per manga panel. **Page & Panels** outputs a list of prompts and panel sizes, so the single sampler chain renders every panel in panel order; **Page Compose** frames and letters the page.\n\n**Character identity: SnapRef** (snapref_v2a_pre2). Pick the character picture inside the SnapRef node. Mode *Character* keeps the character and leaves the art style to the model and the artists; *Character & Style* also copies the picture's drawing style.\n\nTwo characters: stitch both pictures side by side and write who is on the left and right in the panel prompt.\n\n**Global style** (pick one):\n- **Anima Artist Mixer**: artists in *artist_chain*, mixed per artist without prompt interference.\n- **Style tags**: empty *artist_chain* and write the artist tags (e.g. @artist) in *style* on Page & Panels.\n\nPanel prompts are Danbooru tags: count (1girl, solo), framing (close-up, cowboy shot, wide shot, from below), then pose, place, light. Never name the character or describe hair/outfit; the reference does that.\n\nModel: **mangaVisionANIIL_animaV1** (Anima manga finetune), er_sde, 30 steps, cfg 4.5."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Anima Komikku · SnapRef\n\nOne Anima prompt per manga panel. **Page & Panels** outputs a list of prompts and panel sizes, so the single sampler chain renders every panel in panel order; **Page Compose** frames and letters the page.\n\n**Character identity: SnapRef** (snapref_v2a_pre2). Pick the character picture inside the SnapRef node. Mode *Character* keeps the character and leaves the art style to the model and the artists; *Character & Style* also copies the picture's drawing style.\n\nTwo characters: stitch both pictures side by side and write who is on the left and right in the panel prompt.\n\n**Global style** (pick one):\n- **Anima Artist Mixer**: artists in *artist_chain*, mixed per artist without prompt interference.\n- **Style tags**: empty *artist_chain* and write the artist tags (e.g. @artist) in *style* on Page & Panels.\n\nPanel prompts are Danbooru tags: count (1girl, solo), framing (close-up, cowboy shot, wide shot, from below), then pose, place, light. Never name the character or describe hair/outfit; the reference does that.\n\nModel: **mangaVisionANIIL_animaV1** (Anima manga finetune), er_sde, 30 steps, cfg 4.5."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
